@title Double-clicking a tag label next to a pin renames, not wires (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Test report 30 and 35: a double click on a tag label beside a pin started a wire, and a rename field that failed to open left Ctrl+A selecting the whole page.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
try click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button
wait 20
# egui counts a third click when the click before the pair is under 0.6 s old, so wait real time first.
click 1100 600
wait_s 1
click 989 465 double
wait 8
shot double
expect "Enter renames"
key ctrl+a
text K77
wait 5
shot typed
expect "K77"
